title: Handoff OS
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - name: Serio NGO
    website: https://serio.org.pl
    city: Warsaw
    country: PL
repository-code: https://github.com/serio-ngo/handoff-os
url: https://github.com/serio-ngo/handoff-os
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code plugin that keeps a one-person organisation's AI agent inside human control:
  a hook-enforced egress lock so no outward action runs without a person, an append-only audit
  line per write, a gate that refuses a completion claim until the verification command ran,
  and caps on agent fan-out and repeated reads so spend stays inside a flat subscription.
keywords:
  - human-in-the-loop
  - ai-governance
  - guardrails
  - audit-trail
  - claude-code
  - nonprofit
